ifted. Here's an example of a response from Claude after being reminded to use Caveman:\n\n```\nCaveman: right, slipped. Back on now.\n\nBug cause: DepthPrime writes depth across whole silhouette — including alpha≈0 texels\n(only clipped when _ALPHATEST_ON). Those see-through texels prime depth → occlude stuff\nbehind → you see background (gray) instead. Fix: clip low-alpha texels in prime so\ngenuinely-transparent regions don't write depth.\n```\n\nThis was only the second message from Claude in the entire session, so I wouldn't expect it to be drifting this hard or this fast. It didn't even make it 2 sentences in before reverting back to \"genuinely\".","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuliusBrussee/caveman/issues/comments/4804036882/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuliusBrussee/caveman/issues/comments/4842296706","html_url":"https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman/issues/303#issuecomment-4842296706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuliusBrussee/caveman/issues/303","id":4842296706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOR5h10c8AAAABIJ-Vgg","user":{"login":"sztomi","id":240594,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDU5NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240594?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi","html_url":"https://github.com/sztomi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sztomi/repos","events_url":"https://api.gi